Error [E2912]: `reactive.derived` must compute and return a value
  --> tests/ui/reactive_derived_returns_nothing.jet:4:27
    |
  4 |     d := reactive.derived(() => {
    |                           ^^^^^^^
 Why: a derived value is recomputed from its signals; its lambda has to return the value
 Fix: return a value from the body, or use `reactive.effect(() => { … })` for a side effect

Error [E0311]: `get` isn't a method on this value
  --> tests/ui/reactive_derived_returns_nothing.jet:7:13
    |
  7 |     print(d.get())
    |             ^^^
 Why: only struct and enum values have instance methods
 Fix: check the spelling of `get`
